# Bright Data Scraper Studio — Scrape-Verse

Always run the Bright Data CLI through:
`npx -p @brightdata/cli bdata ...`

Never create a new scraper when a Collector ID already exists in
`data/collectors.json`. Reuse `bdata scraper run <collector_id>`, and repair
breakage with `bdata scraper heal <collector_id>` so the `c_*` stays the same.
A new ID would break every schedule and app already calling the old one.

