Prefer the wrappers in this repo over raw CLI calls, because they snapshot and
score the result instead of just printing it:

```
npm run sentinel:run   -- <id> [--url URL]
npm run sentinel:heal  -- <id> --auto
npm run sentinel:watch -- <id>          # run → detect → heal → re-run
```

Do not scrape login-walled, paywalled, government, or personal data.
Prefer long-tail public sites over targets already covered by Bright Data's
800+ pre-built scraper library.
